# Copy to `.env` in the repo root (gitignored). Used by training and smoke scripts.
# Paths must exist on your machine. Quote values if they contain spaces.
# Missing paths make the smoke exit 77 (skipped). Convention: docs/developer/smoke-tests.md.

# SDXL (tests/fixtures/smoke/train_sdxl.toml, LoRA configs with checkpoint_path omitted)
RENGU_SDXL_CHECKPOINT_PATH=/path/to/sdxl.safetensors

# Cosmos Predict2 (tests/fixtures/smoke/train_cosmos_predict2.toml)
RENGU_COSMOS_TRANSFORMER_PATH=/path/to/transformer.safetensors
RENGU_COSMOS_VAE_PATH=/path/to/qwen_image_vae.safetensors
RENGU_COSMOS_LLM_PATH=/path/to/qwen_3_06b_base.safetensors

# Krea 2 (tests/fixtures/smoke/train_krea2.toml). Set the three component files, or only
# RENGU_KREA2_CHECKPOINT_PATH (diffusers Krea-2-Raw folder; fills any component left unset).
# scripts/smoke_mini.py --model krea2 needs no weights (tiny random model).
RENGU_KREA2_TRANSFORMER_PATH=/path/to/krea2_raw_bf16.safetensors
RENGU_KREA2_VAE_PATH=/path/to/qwen_image_vae.safetensors
RENGU_KREA2_TEXT_ENCODER_PATH=/path/to/qwen3vl_4b_bf16.safetensors
# RENGU_KREA2_CHECKPOINT_PATH=/path/to/Krea-2-Raw

# Qwen-Image 2.1 (no smoke fixture yet; env overrides [model] paths of any qwen_image21 TOML).
# Set the three ComfyUI bf16 files, or only RENGU_QWEN_IMAGE21_DIFFUSERS_PATH (the
# Qwen/Qwen-Image-2.1 diffusers folder; fills any component left unset).
RENGU_QWEN_IMAGE21_TRANSFORMER_PATH=/path/to/qwen_image_2.1_bf16.safetensors
RENGU_QWEN_IMAGE21_VAE_PATH=/path/to/qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors
RENGU_QWEN_IMAGE21_TEXT_ENCODER_PATH=/path/to/qwen3vl_8b_bf16.safetensors
# RENGU_QWEN_IMAGE21_DIFFUSERS_PATH=/path/to/Qwen-Image-2.1

# Nanosaur2 (scripts/run_model_smoke.sh nanosaur2|nanosaur2_full): the three release files of
# well9472/Nanosaur2-670M (MIT, not gated) — uncomment and point at your downloads:
#   https://huggingface.co/well9472/Nanosaur2-670M/resolve/main/nanosaur2_diffusion_model.safetensors
#   https://huggingface.co/well9472/Nanosaur2-670M/resolve/main/nanosaur2_vae.safetensors
#   https://huggingface.co/well9472/Nanosaur2-670M/resolve/main/nanosaur2_text_encoder.safetensors
# RENGU_NANOSAUR2_TRANSFORMER_PATH=/path/to/nanosaur2_diffusion_model.safetensors
# RENGU_NANOSAUR2_VAE_PATH=/path/to/nanosaur2_vae.safetensors
# RENGU_NANOSAUR2_TEXT_ENCODER_PATH=/path/to/nanosaur2_text_encoder.safetensors

# MOSS-Image (scripts/run_model_smoke.sh moss_image|moss_image_lokr|moss_image_full): the bf16 files of
# Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image (never the int8_convrot / w4a8 ones) — or the whole OpenMOSS-Team/MOSS-Image-Base
# download in RENGU_MOSS_IMAGE_DIFFUSERS_PATH (fills any component left unset). Apache-2.0, not gated:
#   https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/diffusion_models/moss_image_base_bf16.safetensors
#   https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/vae/flux2-vae_small.safetensors
#   https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3.5_9b_bf16.safetensors
# RENGU_MOSS_IMAGE_TRANSFORMER_PATH=/path/to/moss_image_base_bf16.safetensors
# RENGU_MOSS_IMAGE_VAE_PATH=/path/to/flux2-vae_small.safetensors
# RENGU_MOSS_IMAGE_TEXT_ENCODER_PATH=/path/to/qwen3.5_9b_bf16.safetensors
# RENGU_MOSS_IMAGE_DIFFUSERS_PATH=/path/to/MOSS-Image-Base

# Optional: same vars work for any TOML — env overrides [model] paths when set.
